{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_spot_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_spot_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "誰是英雄",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_spot_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "aa2371d70331dc0aabc679cdd07e7f01dc11052b58519a2d2403113cbceeb785",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑點哥哥。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑點哥哥，我來還漫畫啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "唔，門沒有鎖......斑點哥哥，不在？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡自己把漫畫放回去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "糟、糟了，泡普卡把書架撞倒了？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "得把書架立起來......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "可是這麼多漫畫都掉在地上......不知道哪本該放在什麼地方......斑點哥哥，會生氣嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "先把標題一樣的漫畫堆到一起，等斑點哥哥回來吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "咦？為什麼這本漫畫沒有標題？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡從書堆中揀出一個格格不入的皮面本子。純色的封面上，除了灰塵什麼都沒有，沒有標題，沒有插畫，甚至連一個字都沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "這本漫畫該放哪一堆呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡打開本子，紙張有點泛黃。上面倒也有漫畫，只不過那些線條顯然不是印刷的產物，而是某個人自己用筆劃下來的。\n雖然看起來不甚專業，漫畫的內容卻不是隨意塗鴉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "我的膝蓋，我的腿......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "博爾努，你就不能跟你爸說兩句好話，給我們換個好相處的長官嗎？跟我們一起在這練一個小時匍匐前進，好玩嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "試過，沒用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "這個博爾努，長得和斑點哥哥好像！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡記得斑點哥哥的名字是叫......伯、博......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "對了，伯克依·博爾努！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "啊，這裡，線條畫到框外去了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "稍息——立正！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "看看你們成什麼樣子？鬆鬆垮垮，站沒站相！前線的兄弟們每天流汗流血，你們呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "居然還有人敢看什麼漫畫書——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "——博爾努准將！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "稍息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "誰看漫畫了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "報告，是伯克依·博爾努！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡翻到下一頁，一個拉遠的鏡頭占了整整一頁：\n士兵博爾努在宿舍裡偷藏的漫畫被搜了出來，堆在軍營中央。\n在本子上畫漫畫的人細細地畫出了那些漫畫的封面、標題、冊數，筆觸很重，幾乎把紙劃破了。\n而周圍的人被他幾筆帶過，甚至顯得有些虛幻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "全體都有——蹲下！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "博爾努，你不用蹲。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "你來把這些漫畫裡的台詞一句不落地讀一遍。你什麼時候讀完，他們什麼時候站起來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "報告，博爾努准將，漫畫是我自己的，我可以自己蹲著讀......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "你不幹，他們就在這蹲到明天。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "就連這些胡編亂造的漫畫都知道，一個人至少應該對自己造出來的爛攤子負責。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "父親",
      "text": "連這一點都做不到，你還好意思看什麼英雄漫畫？你想當英雄？你也配？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "青年把所有漫畫讀完，已經過了兩個小時。\n士兵們原本還有些同情他，但蹲了兩個小時之後，他們看青年的眼神裡只剩下怨懟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "看漫畫，是這麼壞的事情嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "不，一定是博爾努的父親——一定是斑點哥哥的父親誤會了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那件事之後，整支隊伍被送上前線。\n士兵們普遍覺得這是博爾努准將被兒子惹怒後的決定，士兵博爾努的處境越發難堪。\n終於，士兵博爾努選擇逃跑。\n他尚未逃出軍營就被巡邏兵抓住，敵人卻恰好在此時襲來。\n敵人的攻勢迅猛，本就士氣不振的軍隊瞬間被衝垮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "現在這裡沒人，我們倆分頭跑吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "你那是什麼表情？難道你事到如今才想起來你有個將軍父親？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "我恨他。他侮辱我，貶低我，說我永遠成不了英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "那你還猶豫什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "可我不想事事順他的意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "你發燒了？腦子被震壞了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "假如我真的在戰場上開溜，我的名字就會順理成章地變成逃兵的名字，被他掛在嘴邊，成為永遠的恥辱！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "士兵",
      "text": "是啊，然後呢？難道你還真想當什麼英雄不成？先保住你自己那條小命吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "我也知道自己成不了英雄。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "但我要是死了，那個老東西說不定會後悔，就算不後悔也無話可說；要是我活下來了，我要把他這些年嘲諷我的每一句話都原樣還回去！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "你要是想跑就跑吧。這是我自己的事，我自己的家庭問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "博爾努，出列！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "為了表彰博爾努在上次戰鬥中做出的貢獻，特授予其二級英雄士兵獎章！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "長官",
      "text": "請博爾努自己朗讀嘉獎令內容！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉甸甸的獎章掛在胸前，嘉獎令拿在手中。\n青年壓抑著洶湧的情感，在開始朗讀之前掃視下面的人群，其中沒有父親的身影。\n帶著半分遺憾和半分釋然，他讀了起來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "......特予嘉獎，此令。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "准將，博爾努。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "青年",
      "text": "博爾努......？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "嗚嗚......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡就知道，斑點哥哥的父親一定會和他和好的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "泡普卡擦了擦眼睛，翻到下一頁，卻只看到一片空白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "後面沒有了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "泡普卡，你在看什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "哇！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "對不起，斑點哥哥，我不是故意把書架弄倒的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "唉，你當然不是故意的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "等等，你在看的是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡好喜歡這本漫畫！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "這本漫畫是斑點哥哥畫的自己的故事，對不對？泡普卡從來都不知道，原來斑點哥哥這麼厲害！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "那個不是——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "不知為何，這句話到了嘴邊，斑點卻說不出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "泡普卡，快到睡覺時間了，去找梓蘭吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "嗯！明天還有例行訓練，梓蘭姐姐還在訓練之後安排了聚餐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "你不說我都忘了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "......斑點哥哥，生氣了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "哪有。跟月見夜我都沒生過氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "快回去吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑點拿起本子，遲疑了片刻，轉頭整理起掉了滿地的漫畫。\n這些漫畫他瞭若指掌，他看一眼背面的插圖就知道這是哪個作者的哪一部漫畫的第幾冊。整理這些東西要不了多長時間。\n所有漫畫都歸位之後，斑點再次看向那個皮面本子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "不行，我得去跟泡普卡說一聲，讓她別把剛剛看的東西告訴別人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "什麼英雄啊，我早都死心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "假如，至少在泡普卡他們面前，我能像個英雄一樣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "——不可能。我根本不是那塊料。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "可......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "聚餐，聚餐！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "是啊，聚餐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "（歎氣聲）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "多虧大家第二次實戰訓練的時候表現不錯，要不然聚餐可就泡湯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "哼哼，為了不被杜賓教官留下加訓，我可是使出了渾身解數！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "有嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "呃......七八成總是有的吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "恕我直言，今天的例行訓練，大家的表現都堪稱完美。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "不過，如果要評選今天訓練中表現最好的一位，我只能當仁不讓、勉為其難，推薦我自己了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6組員們",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "嘖嘖，如此冷淡的反應，真是令人痛心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "尤其是你，斑點老兄，不打算對我完美的戰鬥發表一些意見嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "剛剛在想事情，沒聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "多麼冷淡的——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "好了，月見夜，閉嘴。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "（優雅地聳肩）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "不過我說實話，今天表現最好的其實是斑點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "沒錯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "今天第一次實戰時，斑點哥哥的動作怪怪的，好像要跟杜賓教官一對一戰鬥一樣，泡普卡有點擔心......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "但第二次實戰就不一樣了！斑點哥哥的治療很及時，還幫泡普卡擋下了杜賓教官的攻擊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "那一擋很關鍵的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我看到杜賓教官攻擊的角度就知道要糟，沒想到斑點像瞬間移動一樣頂上了那個位置。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "要不是斑點補位及時，杜賓教官肯定會在泡普卡被命中之後衝著我來，要是那樣，我們就崩盤了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "確有其事！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "斑點老兄在第一次實戰中的英雄氣概，在第二次實戰中的機智靈活，都差一點就讓我甘拜下風——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "月見夜，少說兩句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "斑點他......心情不太好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "所以泡普卡還是告訴你了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "（點頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "為什麼......為什麼大家突然不高興了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑點哥哥，是泡普卡不該把漫畫的事告訴——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "泡普卡，現在先不要說這個，好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "呃——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "所以說——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "對了，聚餐！梓蘭姐，今天食堂人會不會很多啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "別擔心，有我們心思縝密的梓蘭小姐在，就算再怎麼擁擠，我們也能在食堂佔據一席之地，我說得沒錯吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑點哥哥，不要生氣......泡普卡錯了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "昨天說過了，我沒生氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我只是......有些話，不知道該不該說，沒想好該怎麼說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "不知道該怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "就像——嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "月見夜，隨便講點什麼。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "哦？終於，斑點你也需要從我頭腦的深井中汲取靈感了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "不好意思，我頭一次聽人說自己的腦袋裡全是水。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "泡普卡，所謂“沒想好該怎麼說”，就相當於只想到了“呃”，還沒想到“腦袋裡全是水”。明白了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "總之，等到了食堂，我會講清楚的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "所以，泡普卡沒做錯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "那泡普卡可以把斑點哥哥的事蹟告訴大家嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "泡普卡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "沒事，說吧，泡普卡。你替我說了，我正好少說兩句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "斑點，看不出來，你以前竟然這麼厲害？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "在敗軍之際收攏殘兵，讓二百人重新歸隊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "雖然很不甘心，但我不得不說，這可是實打實讓我甘拜下風的戰績。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "被別人知道這種事，有什麼好不高興的？如果是我，我一定會將那枚勳章一直掛在胸前，向所有人展示我的英雄事蹟。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我沒得到勳章。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "他們沒給你授勳？多麼嚴重的失察行為——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "因為......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑點抓起麵包咬了一口。\n他以為自己會狠狠咬下去，然後在發力這一行為中得到一點勇氣。\n但他沒有。\n他下顎用力的方式與平時別無二致，從咀嚼到吞咽都順滑無比，連他自己都沒想到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "因為我根本就沒收攏什麼殘兵。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "那個晚上，敵人攻來之後，我身邊很快就一個人也不剩了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我抓住機會從包圍中逃了出去，然後......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑點幾乎是刻意地停了下來，喝了口果汁。\n他怕自己哽住，但他又多慮了。\n他曾經決定把這段經歷永遠隱藏下去。\n而此時此刻，他猛然發現，在這些朝夕相處的夥伴面前，瞞住不說才是更加困難的選擇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "沒有什麼逆反心理，也沒有什麼收攏殘兵，更沒有什麼授勳儀式。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我逃了，就這麼簡單。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "對於一個被全軍討厭的兵來說，逃走既符合大家的期待，又適合自己的性格。這叫適才適所，物盡其用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "要是真跑上去假裝英雄，那才是不解風情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "斑點，你也不必這麼說自己......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "沒關係。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "梓蘭，你也是，你一定是覺得那樣的英雄事蹟和我對不上號，這才不想讓泡普卡告訴大家的，沒錯吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "......沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一陣沉默。\n對A6組來說，這樣的沉默頗為罕見。\n斑點環顧四周。\n泡普卡有些沮喪，月見夜則是一臉輕浮；梓蘭稍微有點緊張，不停用勺子攪咖啡，空爆還是一貫的坐沒坐相。\n這些人唯一的共同點是，斑點能從他們身上感受到絲毫不摻假的關切。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "然後你......畫了泡普卡說的那個漫畫？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "是啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "那支部隊其實蠢透了，當年我乖乖聽老頭子安排去那裡受罪，其實腦子裡的水不比現在的月見夜少。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "軍官從來不把士兵當人看，每個月都有士兵因為過量訓練倒下，最後還要為了王酋之間毫無意義的摩擦流血......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "要說那段經歷有什麼好處，大概只有炎熱的天氣吧。高溫把我腦子裡的水蒸幹了，讓我終於想到了逃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "但是......\n假如我不逃，會怎麼樣？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "很長一段時間，我擺脫不了這個念頭，最終就有了那本自我美化的塗鴉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "畫的時候，我一度傻乎乎地幻想，要是當時沒跑，說不定老頭子會對我刮目相看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "......斑點老兄，恕我直言，以我對你這個人精準的認識，我可以斷言，這不可能。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "月見夜！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "沒關係，讓他說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "很久很久以前，當我仍舊以東夜魔王的名號縱橫業界的時候，我曾有一位努力的同事，他以犀利的言辭聞名——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "雖然只聽了個開頭，但我有種不祥的預感。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "如果你這位同事因為什麼理由進了東國的軍隊，結果無論如何也適應不了，那可真是太令人扼腕歎息了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "（訕笑）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "雖然你這個故事編得讓人一眼望到底，但至少中心思想沒錯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "如果你月見夜哪天成了公認的英雄，我大概會對人類的理性徹底失望。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "但要是哪天我成了公認的英雄，我怕是要被人類的愚蠢嚇瘋。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "說到底，我只是在家庭中耳濡目染，被灌輸了一個根本不適合自己的夢想。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "所以，那本塗鴉畫到授勳就結束了，因為我貧瘠的想像力最多只能想到那一步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "再往後，一個真成了英雄的博爾努該怎麼繼續他的英雄事蹟，我想破了頭也想不出來，因為那根本就是自相矛盾的產物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡，開始聽不懂了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "聽不懂也沒關係，等泡普卡長大了就會明白的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "可泡普卡，是不是做了壞事，讓斑點哥哥不得不說了不想說的話？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "完全沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "欸？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "其實，多虧了泡普卡......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "（撓頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "（眼神遊移）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "（尷尬地清嗓子）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑點哥哥，生病了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "這可不是生病哦，泡普卡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "可斑點哥哥，看起來不太舒服......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "他在醞釀一些從出生開始從來沒說過的肉麻——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "——月見夜，你想好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "——不，讚美的話，第一次跟別人說這種話總是很尷尬的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "就算玲瓏剔透如我，在接待自己的首位客人時，也是手忙腳亂啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "你說是吧，斑點老兄？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "月見夜，明天要不要約個一對一訓練？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "哈哈，我很樂意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "好，那我把剛才的話說完——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "——多虧了泡普卡，我才發現......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "（小聲）......向最信任的人吐露這段可笑的“英雄事蹟”，似乎比一直藏著要更舒服一些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "明白了，斑點老兄的意思是，我們已經是他最信任的人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "斑點，你現在要是想揍他，我沒有任何意見。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "梓蘭小姐——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "雖然這句話被他一覆述還是一如既往地噁心，但是，看在內容沒錯的份上......算了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "這就對了嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空爆",
      "text": "我提議，為了斑點今天給我們講的故事，乾杯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6組組員們",
      "text": "乾杯！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "好了，假英雄的煽情故事到此為止——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "可斑點哥哥就是英雄嘛！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "斑點哥哥幫泡普卡擋住了攻擊，保護了大家，幫大家趕上了聚餐，斑點哥哥就是英雄！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡要給斑點哥哥舉辦授勳儀式！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "A6組組員們",
      "text": "啊？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "授勳儀式上要有泡普卡，有梓蘭姐姐、空爆姐姐、月見夜哥哥......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "嗯，不行......人不夠！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "泡普卡再想想——對了，還有泡泡！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梓蘭",
      "text": "那個，泡普卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "泡普卡",
      "text": "還有巫戀姐姐、鈴蘭姐姐......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "梓蘭、空爆，幫幫忙，我有預感，今天我們要有一場苦戰了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "那我呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我打算跟食堂管理員說是你惹泡普卡鬧起來的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我覺得你有權回宿舍，為自己的薪資哀悼了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "是誰？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "是我，斑點老兄，我來給你送件東西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "給，這是泡普卡送你的“英雄證書”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "英雄證書？？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "我們不是磨破嘴皮，說服泡普卡放棄授勳儀式的傻念頭了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "回宿舍之後，泡普卡又有了新想法，這次誰也勸不住她了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "總之，這是她手繪的英雄證書，給你了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "她還要求我們在上面簽上自己的名字。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "你們簽了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "當然。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "現在就差你的啦。只要你把自己的名字簽上去，你就是A6組全員一致通過的英雄了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑點沒有接話。\n他用兩手捧著那張“英雄證書”，上面寫著泡普卡能想出的最正式的“頒獎詞”，四周還畫著稚拙的裝飾畫和花邊。\n斑點把“頒獎詞”細細讀了一遍，然後，在手感厚實的紙張最下方，看到了四個人的簽名。\n他心裡一熱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "怎麼樣，需不需要我借你一支高級鋼筆，好讓你的名字在其中顯得與眾不同？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "那倒不用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "斑點並未簽字，而是從儲物櫃裡拿出了一個精美的相框，將“英雄證書”裝飾在其中。\n他把相框放在床頭最顯眼的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "這可不行，斑點老兄，你就這麼放棄簽字，泡普卡可是會鬧的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "你不是怕泡普卡鬧，你是怕泡普卡一鬧起來，梓蘭就會找你麻煩。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "精準的判斷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "誇我也沒用，我是不會簽的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "和當英雄相比，還是現在的生活更適合我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "怎麼，不說點什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "我只是太感動，我終於用自己的真情融化了斑點老兄如同堅冰一般的心——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "......月見夜，我突然改主意了。英雄好像也不是特別難做。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "月見夜",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "下次再和你出任務的時候，我給你偷偷安排一個暴脾氣的姑娘讓你去搭訕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "斑點",
      "text": "等到你被揍得去醫務室躺上個十天半個月，到時候我就是整個A6組的英雄了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "二人相對大笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
